iki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:51ab452f-8bfe-4807-a544-edc528c5dbcc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:51ab452f-8bfe-4807-a544-edc528c5dbcc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth_Basement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth Basement\">Baldur's Mouth Basement</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-999&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1034</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Use this to collect the News Hawker sales at the end of the day and to give them change for tomorrow. Do NOT give Luan another float, if he keeps 'misplacing' it he'll have to give change out of his own pocket.\n</p><p><br>\n- Ettvard Needle, Editor in Chief, Baldur's Mouth Gazette\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1613/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28743/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6642/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936289/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.409      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.409      1 -total\n 60.12%